				</div>
				<!-- End Right Column -->


				<div class="leftcol game_description_column"  data-panel="{&quot;flow-children&quot;:&quot;column&quot;}" >

					
												<div id="earlyAccessHeader" class="early_access_header">
		<div class="heading">
												<h2 class="inset">Early Access Game</h2>
					<p class="inset subtitle">Get instant access and start playing; get involved with this game as it develops.</p>
				
				<p><span>Note:</span> Games in Early Access are not complete and may or may not change further. If you are not excited to play this game in its current state, then you
									should wait to see if the game progresses further in development. <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/earlyaccessfaq/?snr=1_5_9_">Learn more</a></p>
					</div>
				<div id="earlyAccessBody" class="devnotes">
							<div class="devs_say">What the developers have to say:</div>
			
			<div id="devnotes_expander">
									<h3>Why Early Access?</h3>
					“We chose to release this title in Early Access to actively include the community in its development. This allows us to shape the game in a way that reflects the expectations and wishes of the players. During the Early Access phase, we’ll continuously expand the game’s content through regular updates. In addition, we’ll closely listen to player feedback, suggestions, and constructive criticism to help guide and refine future improvements wherever possible.”
					<h3>Approximately how long will this game be in Early Access?</h3>
					“We plan to have the Early Access Status finished in mid of 2027, but it's strongly depending on the feedback of the community for new features.”
					<h3>How is the full version planned to differ from the Early Access version?</h3>
					“We plan to continuously expand the simulator with new playable ships, varied missions and real-world inspired scenarios, improved step-by-step tutorials, and robust modding support—allowing players to create, customize, and share their own experiences.”
					<h3>What is the current state of the Early Access version?</h3>
					“The current Early Access version already offers a solid foundation of core gameplay systems and content. Players can experience a detailed and realistic physics model that forms the basis of the simulation, providing authentic ship handling and behavior. The game features two large main scenery to explore. In addition, there are eight different mission types available, offering a variety of tasks and challenges. To help players get started, the game also includes the first set of scenarios and tutorials, guiding you through the fundamentals and introducing key mechanics step by step.”
					<h3>Will the game be priced differently during and after Early Access?</h3>
					“The price will remain unchanged throughout the Early Access period. An adjustment may follow upon the full release of the game.”
					<h3>How are you planning on involving the Community in your development process?</h3>
					“The community will play an integral role in the entire development process, contributing feedback, ideas, and suggestions that help shape the future of the game. Our discord server will be the main point of contact with the community.”
							</div> <!-- /devnotes_expander -->
			<a class="morebutton" id="devnotes_more" href="#"  onclick="$J('#devnotes_expander').css({'max-height': 'none'}); $J(this).hide(); return false;">Read more</a>
		</div>
	</div>
										
					
